          <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold"><span style="color: #f1c40f;">Dhuleva Marine Lines Mumbai</span></h1>
          <p class="lead mt-3 mb-4" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #f0f0f0;">Dhuleva Marine Lines Mumbai is a premium residential redevelopment by the trusted Dhuleva Group, located near Marine Lines in South Mumbai. This thoughtfully designed project offers comfortable 2 and 3 BHK homes that blend modern architecture with smart living spaces. Register now for exclusive access and early bird offers.</p>
          <button class="btn btn-lg px-4 py-3" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#exampleModal" style="background-color:#b87c10; color:#ffffff; border:none; border-radius: 50px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); font-size: 1.1rem;"><b>Get Latest Price List</b></button>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 text-center mt-5 mt-lg-0">
          <img src="images/dhuleva-marine-lines-mumbai.webp" class="img-fluid floating" alt="Luxury residential tower of Dhuleva Marine Lines Mumbai offering premium apartments in Marine Lines" style="max-height: 400px;">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
<section class="about_us ptb-80 bg-grey" id="About">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-12 text-center">
                <h2>About Dhuleva Marine Lines Mumbai</h2>
                <span class="divied" style="display: block; margin: 20px auto 30px auto; width: 80px; height: 4px; background-color: #001d3d; border-radius: 2px;"></span>
                </div>
             <p>Dhuleva Marine Lines Mumbai is a stunning residential redevelopment by <strong>Dhuleva Group</strong>, spread across approximately <strong>2 acres near Marine Lines in South Mumbai</strong>. The development has a gross development value of around <strong>₹1,000 Crore</strong>, offering a limited collection of well-designed <strong>2 and 3 BHK apartments</strong>. Prices are available on request. The project is expected to be completed by <strong>2030</strong>, making it a premium residential address in one of Mumbai's most sought-after southern neighborhoods.</p>

<p>Located near <strong>Marine Lines, South Mumbai</strong>, Dhuleva Marine Lines Mumbai offers strong connectivity through <strong>major road networks, local trains, and Mumbai Metro</strong>. The location also provides convenient access to major <strong>employment hubs, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, shopping destinations, and lifestyle centres</strong> across South Mumbai and beyond.</p>
                <div class="sattva-highlights" style= "background-color: #1f4b6e; padding: 1px; margin: 15px 0;">
  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; background-color: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">

    <!-- Left Section -->
    <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 300px; padding: 20px;">
      <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #0a3a75; font-size: 1.5rem;"><b>Project Highlights:</b></h3>
      <ul style="padding-left: 25px; margin: 0;">
<li><strong>Project Name</strong>: Dhuleva Marine Lines Mumbai</li>
<li><strong>Developer</strong>: Dhuleva Group</li>
<li><strong>Location</strong>: Near Marine Lines, South Mumbai</li>
<li><strong>Project Type</strong>: Luxury Residential Redevelopment</li>
<li><strong>Land Parcel</strong>: ~2 Acres</li>
<li><strong>GDV</strong>: ~₹1,000 Crore</li>
<li><strong>Configurations</strong>: 2 &amp; 3 BHK Residences</li>
<li><strong>Price</strong>: On Request</li>
<li><strong>Size</strong>: Coming Soon</li>
<li><strong>Possession</strong>: 2030</li>
</ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Section -->
<div style="flex: 1; min-width: 300px; padding: 20px;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #0a3a75; font-size: 1.5rem;"><b>Key Features & Specifications:</b></h3>
  <ul style="padding-left: 25px; margin: 0;">
<li>Spacious 2 &amp; 3 BHK residences</li>
<li>Modern clubhouse with recreational facilities</li>
<li>Landscaped gardens and green open spaces</li>
<li>Swimming pool and children's play area</li>
<li>Fully equipped gym and yoga pavilion</li>
<li>24/7 security with CCTV surveillance</li>
<li>Power backup for common areas</li>
<li>Rainwater harvesting and eco-friendly design</li>
</ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
