                            <p><b>Skating Rink</b></p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="IconBox">
                            <img src="images/amenities/step-garden.jpg" alt="24/7 security with CCTV surveillance throughout the community at Dhuleva Marine Lines Mumbai" loading="lazy">
                            <p><b>Security</b></p>
                        </div>
                </div>
               <p>Dhuleva Marine Lines Mumbai is designed to offer a modern and comfortable lifestyle with a range of premium amenities. Here's what you can look forward to:</p>
<h3><strong>Modern Living Experience</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>Spacious 2 &amp; 3 BHK apartments</li>
<li>Premium vitrified flooring and designer tiles</li>
<li>Modular kitchen with granite countertops</li>
<li>Branded sanitaryware and fittings</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>Recreation & Wellness</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>Swimming pool with separate kids' pool</li>
<li>State-of-the-art gym and yoga pavilion</li>
<li>Jogging track and outdoor fitness zone</li>
<li>Landscaped gardens and meditation area</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>Community & Convenience</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>Modern clubhouse for community events and gatherings</li>
<li>Children's play area and skating rink</li>
<li>Senior citizen sitting area and gazebo</li>
<li>Ample open spaces for outdoor activities</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>Safety & Sustainability</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>24/7 security with CCTV and intercom</li>
<li>Fire safety systems and earthquake-resistant design</li>
<li>Rainwater harvesting and solar lighting</li>
<li>Power backup for common areas</li>
</ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
