            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-12 text-center">
                    <h2>Master Plan & Floor Plan Layout</h2>
                    <span class="divied"></span>
                </div>
             <p>The <strong>master plan of Dhuleva Marine Lines Mumbai</strong> has been carefully crafted to maximize space, light, and ventilation. Spread across ~2 acres, the redevelopment is designed with <strong>vastu principles</strong> and <strong>optimal ventilation</strong> in mind. The project also includes a <strong>modern clubhouse, landscaped gardens, and a children's play area</strong>. With <strong>ample parking space</strong> and <strong>well-designed internal roads</strong>, the project ensures a hassle-free living experience. With <strong>possession expected in 2030</strong>, buyers can register their interest now to get the best options.</p>
